[Name] Clinfo
[Summary] OpenCL platform/device query tool (ICD diagnostic)
[License] MIT
[Homepage] https://github.com/Oblomov/clinfo
[Description] clinfo dumps the OpenCL platforms and devices visible through the OpenCL ICD loader, including the NVIDIA driver's CL device info. Useful to verify the NVIDIA OpenCL stack (libOpenCL.so.1 + nvidia.icd -> libnvidia-opencl.so.1) is wired up on the Live CD.
